_growth":null,"_score_fund_growth":null,"_gate_shrhldr_yield":0.07483983043791366,"_gp_shrhldr_yield":true,"_score_shrhldr_yield":94.3,"_gate_share_shrink":0.03642941555912915,"_gp_share_shrink":false,"_score_share_shrink":4.5,"_gate_sbc_dilution":0.014385584219045714,"_gp_sbc_dilution":true,"_score_sbc_dilution":76.0,"_gate_insider_own":0.059359998,"_gp_insider_own":true,"_score_insider_own":39.6,"_gate_insider_buying":1.0,"_gp_insider_buying":true,"_score_insider_buying":100.0,"pf":[],"description_full":"NewtekOne, Inc. operates as the bank holding company for Newtek Bank, National Association that provides various business and financial solutions under the Newtek and NewtekOne brands to the small- and medium-sized business market. The company accepts demand, savings, NOW, money market, and time deposits; and provides loans including the United States small business administration loans, commercial and industrial loans, and commercial real estate loans. It is also involved in the provision of electronic payment processing services comprising credit and debit card processing services, check approval services, processing equipment, and software, as well as cloud-based point of sale systems for various restaurants, retail, assisted living, taxi cabs, parks, and golf course businesses. In addition, it offers wholesale brokerage insurance agency services; and payroll management, and related payment and tax reporting services to independent business owners, as well as inbound and outbound calling services. The company was formerly known as Newtek Business Services Corp. and changed its name to NewtekOne, Inc. in January 2023. NewtekOne, Inc. was founded in 1998 and is headquartered in Boca Raton, Florida.","ceo_bio":"Mr. Barry Scott Sloane | President, Chairman & CEO | Age 65 | Compensation: $1.0M (FY2025)","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 572 people. Revenue per employee of $498K ranks in the below the sector median among Financial Services peers, with revenue growing 18%/yr across its filed history. Stock-based compensation of $7K per employee reflects an ownership culture. CEO compensation is 2\u00d7 revenue per employee (modest relative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags moderate compensation governance risk (6/10).","financial_summary":["NewtekOne, Inc. is a small-cap financial services business with a $307M market cap on $285M of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +18% over the past three years, the kind of sustained demand persistence that marks a compounder.","The company is burning through $579M of cash, and without positive owner earnings any valuation rests on hope rather than evidence.","Accruals are elevated at +23.3% of assets, and Sloan showed firms building earnings through accruals rather than cash systematically underperform.","On the balance sheet, debt is heavy at 1227.4\u00d7 net debt/EBITDA, and leverage like that is what turns a bad year into a permanent loss.","Management returns a meaningful 7.5% of market cap to owners through dividends and buybacks, a strong signal of disciplined capital allocation, and insiders hold 5.9% of the shares."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Accruals elevated at +23.3% of assets \u2014 Sloan showed firms building earnings through accruals rather than cash systematically underperform","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Piotroski score 2/9 \u2014 the fundamentals are deteriorating on multiple fronts","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (0.2) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Elevated short interest (14.6% of float) \u2014 sophisticated money is betting the other way","sev":"amber","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Carries more leverage than most Financial Services peers \u2014 a smaller cushion for the inevitable bad year","sev":"amber","cat":"balance_sheet"},{"text":"Financial quality metrics lag Financial Services peers","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Credit cycles and regulatory capital \u2014 losses accumulate invisibly in good years and appear all at once, and the time to worry is when underwriting standards are loosest.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Fintech disintermediation \u2014 neobanks, embedded finance, and blockchain rails are unbundling the fee streams that traditional banks took for granted.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Interest rate regime shifts \u2014 a rapid move in rates can invert the yield curve, crush bond portfolios, and trigger deposit flight simultaneously.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Trading at a 34% margin of safety to estimated fair value \u2014 a real cushion against errors in the estimate","Trading near the bottom of its 52-week range \u2014 the market is offering a discount","11 consecutive years of dividend payments \u2014 an operating record that makes the dividend claim credible","Minimal goodwill on the balance sheet \u2014 low impairment risk"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"NewtekOne (NASDAQ:NEWT) Stock Rating Upgraded by Zacks Research","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/12/newtekone-nasdaqnewt-stock-rating-upgraded-by-zacks-research.html","date":"2026-11-12","timestamp":1794488730.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.477,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["analyst_action"]},{"title":"NewtekOne, Inc. (NASDAQ:NEWT) Stock Now Rated \u201cHold\u201d by Sell-Side Brokerages","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/12/newtekone-inc-nasdaqnewt-stock-now-rated-hold-by-sell-side-brokerages.html","date":"2026-11-12","timestamp":1794483909.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.67,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"NewtekOne (NASDAQ:NEWT) Issues Quarterly Earnings Results, Misses Estimates By $0.11 EPS","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/10/28/newtekone-nas